 story is about trust, betrayal, decision-making, technological advancements and fears of them.\nIt discusses the issue of existence and God.", "short_description": "Open world game (includes 3 maps). Sci-fi action.\nThe story is about trust, betrayal, decision-making, technological advancements and fears of them.\nIt discusses the issue of existence and God.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vTMEtpW8pI7eBB0YK2FEwfZdNsEB2GWhoPMz_BTlzDE6moQ3Hy1SkuN9ZsTFMfZp7seI3sDioSIgpNv/pub", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "salem abed", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/eventextinction", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24676916061929805"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3848309818800023"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "3848309818800023"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1759303380, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3848309818800023"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "24668380892783322", "version": "1.0"}, "id": "1794160434645198", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys